                  "snippet": "to the Gallery by Car: The entrance to the Gallery’s carpark is located on St Andrew’s Road. The Gallery’s carpark has three accessible parking lots, one on Level B2 and two on Level B3. The accessible parking lots are located close to Lift Lobby B.",
